- set_meta_tags title: "Podium"

.py-5.text-center
  = image_tag "/podium.png", alt: "Podium", style: "height: 4rem; width: auto; object-fit: contain", class: "mb-4"
  %h1.display-5.fw-bold.mb-3 Podium
  %p.lead.text-muted.mb-5.mx-auto{ style: "max-width: 600px" }
    The white-label commerce platform for auctions, listings, rentals, and more.
    Give your brand a full-featured online storefront — without building it from scratch.

.row.g-4.mb-5
  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-hammer.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Auctions
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Run live and timed auctions with proxy bidding, real-time updates, buyer
          registration, and automated invoicing. Everything you need from listing
          to final payment.

  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-tag-fill.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Listings & Rentals
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Sell products, accept offers, and rent items — all from one platform.
          Variants, stock tracking, discount codes, and flexible delivery options
          are built in.

  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-palette-fill.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Fully White-Label
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Custom domain, your logo, your colours, your brand. Podium stays in the
          background so your customers only ever see you.

.row.g-4.mb-5
  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-people-fill.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Multi-Tenant
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Run multiple independent storefronts from a single installation. Each
          tenant gets its own data, users, and settings — fully isolated.

  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-layout-text-window-reverse.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Pages & Widgets
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Build content pages with galleries, location maps, schedules, contact
          forms, and QR codes using a flexible widget system — no developer
          required.

  .col-md-4
    .card.h-100.border-0.shadow-sm
      .card-body.p-4
        %i.bi.bi-bar-chart-fill.fs-2.text-primary.mb-3.d-block
        %h5.card-title.fw-semibold Built to Scale
        %p.card-text.text-muted
          Backed by PostgreSQL, Solid Queue, Action Cable, and imgproxy.
          Real-time bid updates, background jobs, and optimised image delivery
          all come standard.

.row.justify-content-center.py-4
  .col-lg-6
    - if notice.present?
      .alert.alert-success= notice
    %h2.fw-semibold.mb-1 Interested in Podium?
    %p.text-muted.mb-4 Get in touch and we'll have you up and running in no time.
    = form_with url: podium_path, method: :post, class: "needs-validation", novalidate: true do |f|
      .mb-3
        = f.label :name, "Your name", class: "form-label"
        = f.text_field :name, class: "form-control", placeholder: "Jane Smith"
      .mb-3
        = f.label :email, "Email address", class: "form-label required"
        = f.email_field :email, class: "form-control", placeholder: "jane@example.com", required: true
      .mb-3
        = f.label :message, "Message", class: "form-label required"
        = f.text_area :message, class: "form-control", rows: 5, placeholder: "Tell us a bit about your business and what you're looking for.", required: true
      = f.submit "Send message", class: "btn btn-primary"
